                "content": "![Example 1](https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2019/11/05/e1.png)\n\n```\nInput: grid = [[1,2,3],[4,5,6],[7,8,9]], k = 1\nOutput: [[9,1,2],[3,4,5],[6,7,8]]\n```"
            },
            {
